-lg","children":"문제를 해결하려면 감정을 앞세우기보다, 논리적이고 명료한 언어로 상황을 전달해야 합니다. 오늘은 YES 학생들이 어디서든 당당하게 권리를 주장하고 문제를 해결할 수 있도록, 불만 처리 상황에서 유용한 실용적인 영어 표현 툴킷을 만들어 보겠습니다."}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"1. 시작이 반이다: 정중하고 단호하게 상황 설명하기"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-10-19-complaint-handling-english-1-h2-1.jpg","alt":"1. 시작이 반이다: 정중하고 단호하게 상황 설명하기","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"1. 시작이 반이다: 정중하고 단호하게 상황 설명하기"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"불만 제기는 싸움이 아닙니다. 문제 해결을 위한 협상의 시작이죠. 따라서 첫마디는 정중함과 명확함을 동시에 갖춰야 합니다. 상황을 설명할 때는 배경 정보(주문 번호, 날짜, 장소 등)를 먼저 제시하여 상대방이 빠르게 문제의 핵심으로 접근할 수 있도록 돕는 것이 중요합니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"1.1. 정중한 시작을 위한 오프닝 표현"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"상대방의 시간을 존중하는 표현을 사용하면 대화의 분위기가 훨씬 부드러워집니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I’m afraid I have an issue with...\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I need to bring something to your attention regarding...\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I’m hoping you can help me resolve a problem.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I'm afraid I have an issue with the laptop I purchased online using order number KOR-4567.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I need to bring something to your attention regarding my hotel reservation for Friday the 13th.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"1.2. 배경 정보 제시"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"문제 자체를 설명하기 전에, 어떤 거래나 서비스에 대한 불만인지 명확히 알려주세요."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I am calling about...\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"This relates to...\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I am calling about the dinner delivery that arrived late last night.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"This relates to an unauthorized transaction of $500 that appeared on my bank statement on Tuesday.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-1",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"2. 증거 제시와 핵심 문제 명료화 (The Core Issue)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-10-19-complaint-handling-english-1-h2-2.jpg","alt":"2. 증거 제시와 핵심 문제 명료화 (The Core Issue)","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"2. 증거 제시와 핵심 문제 명료화 (The Core Issue)"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"가장 중요한 단계입니다. 감정적인 표현(I am so angry!)보다는, 사실(Fact)과 증거(Evidence)에 기반하여 문제점을 서술해야 합니다. 언제, 무엇이, 어떻게 잘못되었는지를 명료하게 전달할수록 상대방은 해결책을 더 빨리 찾을 수 있습니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"2.1. 문제 발생을 알리는 필수 동사"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"제품이나 서비스의 상태를 묘사할 때 자주 쓰이는 동사들을 익혀두세요."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"was charged for"}]," (잘못 청구되다)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"is defective"}]," (결함이 있다)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"is leaking/is missing"}]," (물이 새다/누락되다)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"stopped working"}]," (작동을 멈췄다)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"is expired"}]," (만료되었다)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"2.2. 문제점을 구체적으로 묘사하는 구조"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"문제 묘사는 다음과 같은 구조로 진행하는 것이 효과적입니다: [발생 시점] + [문제점] + [영향]."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"The coffee maker I purchased last Monday is leaking water from the bottom whenever I try to brew a full pot.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"When I checked out this morning, I was incorrectly charged for an extra night, even though I clearly cancelled the booking two days prior.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I noticed that the new pair of jeans I received has a large tear along the back seam, making them unwearable.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"2.3. 기대치와의 차이 강조"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"서비스에 대한 불만을 제기할 때는 내가 기대했던 기준과 실제 받은 서비스의 차이를 명시하세요."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"The hotel room was advertised as having an ocean view, but my room faces the parking lot instead.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I ordered the expedited shipping service which guarantees two-day delivery, but the package is now delayed by four days.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-2",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"3. 원하는 해결책을 정확하게 요구하기 (Stating the Desired Outcome)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-10-19-complaint-handling-english-1-h2-3.jpg","alt":"3. 원하는 해결책을 정확하게 요구하기 (Stating the Desired Outcome)","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"3. 원하는 해결책을 정확하게 요구하기 (Stating the Desired Outcome)"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"많은 사람이 문제점을 이야기하는 것까지는 잘하지만, 자신이 원하는 바를 명확하게 요청하지 못합니다. 해결책을 요구할 때는 단호하고 구체적인 어휘를 사용해야 합니다. 해결책의 종류는 보통 환불(Refund), 교환(Exchange), 수리(Repair) 등이 있습니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"3.1. 원하는 해결책 제시 표현"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"'I would like'는 정중한 표현이지만, 상황에 따라서는 'I expect'나 'I require'를 사용하여 단호함을 보여줄 필요가 있습니다."}],"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 w-full overflow-y-auto rounded-[10px] border border-gray-200","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full","children":[["$","thead",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200","children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","th",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"해결 유형"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"주요 표현"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"className":"divide-y divide-gray-100","children":[["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"환불 (Refund)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"I would like a full refund. / I expect the full amount to be refunded."}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"교환 (Exchange)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"I need to exchange this item for a new one. / Can I exchange it for a different size/color?"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"수리/AS (Repair)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"I need this item repaired under warranty. / I require a technician to assess the damage."}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"보상 (Compensation)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"I expect some compensation for the inconvenience caused."}]]}]]}]]}]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"3.2. 단호한 요청 예문"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"요청의 근거를 포함하여 문장을 완성하면 더욱 설득력이 있습니다."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문 (환불):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"Since the dishwasher is completely unusable, I require a full refund of the purchase price, $799, to be processed by the end of the week.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"Given the server outage lasted for 48 hours, I expect at least a 50% credit on my monthly service bill.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문 (교환/수리):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I would like to exchange this medium-sized jacket for a large, and I expect the shipping fee for the replacement to be covered by your company.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"If a full refund is not possible, I must insist that the washing machine be repaired within the next three business days at no extra cost to me.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-3",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"4. 후속 조치 및 상황 격상 (Follow-up and Escalation)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-10-19-complaint-handling-english-1-h2-4.jpg","alt":"4. 후속 조치 및 상황 격상 (Follow-up and Escalation)","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"4. 후속 조치 및 상황 격상 (Follow-up and Escalation)"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"문제가 한 번에 해결되지 않거나, 약속된 기한 내에 조치가 이루어지지 않을 때가 있습니다. 이럴 때는 상황을 격상(Escalate)시키거나 후속 조치(Follow-up)를 취해야 합니다. 핵심은 침착함을 유지하며 다음 단계를 요구하는 것입니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"4.1. 후속 조치 요청 (Follow-up)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"약속 이행을 독촉하거나 상황을 다시 확인할 때 사용하는 표현입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I am following up on our conversation from...\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"Could you please confirm...\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I have yet to receive...\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I am following up on our conversation from Tuesday, where you promised to send a replacement tracking number. I have yet to receive the email.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"Could you please confirm the date and time when the technician will arrive to fix the air conditioner?\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"4.2. 상황 격상 및 관리자 요청 (Escalation)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"담당자가 문제를 해결할 능력이 없거나 의지가 부족하다고 판단되면, 매니저나 상급자에게 문제를 넘겨야 합니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"I need to speak to your supervisor/manager.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"If this issue is not resolved by [날짜], I will have to take further steps.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"✅ 구체적 예문:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"Since this issue has not been resolved after three separate calls, I must insist on speaking with a manager who can authorize a final resolution.\""}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":"\"If the missing furniture piece is not shipped out by this Friday, I will have to dispute the charge with my credit card company.\""}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-4",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"마무리하며: 자신감은 최고의 무기입니다"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"불만 제기 영어 툴킷을 살펴봤습니다. 불만을 제기하는 상황은 불편하지만, 이는 우리가 소비자의 권리를 주장하고 더 나은 서비스와 제품을 만들어가는 과정의 일부입니다."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["영어 회화에서 가장 중요한 것은 유창함보다 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"자신감"}],"과 ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"명확성"}],"입니다. 오늘 배운 구체적이고 템플릿화되지 않은 표현들을 YES 화상영어 수업에서 선생님과 함께 연습해 보세요. 실제 상황극을 통해 문제 발생부터 해결책 요구, 그리고 후속 조치까지 시뮬레이션 해본다면, 여러분은 어떤 상황에서도 당황하지 않고 문제를 해결하는 능력 있는 영어 사용자가 될 것입니다."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"다음 시간에도 YES 학생들에게 실질적인 도움이 될 수 있는 주제로 돌아오겠습니다!"}]]}]}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"posts":[{"slug":"2025-11-23-travel-english-phrases-1","title":"여행 영어 정복 챌린지: 공항에서 미슐랭 레스토랑까지, YES와 함께하는 3단계 스킬업","subtitle":"YES 학생들을 위한 실전 여행 영어 표현 마스터하기: 단계별 난이도로 자신감 높이기","date":"$D2025-11-23T02:55:18.218Z","featuredImage":"/images/blog/2025-11-23-travel-english-phrases-1.jpg","excerpt":"해외여행 시 마주치는 공항, 호텔, 레스토랑에서 막힘없이 영어를 구사할 수 있도록 돕는 실전 챌린지입니다. 기본 생존 영어부터 복잡한 문제 해결까지, 단계별 미션을 통해 영어 실력과 자신감을 동시에 향상시키세요."},{"slug":"2026-04-22-medical-english-healthcare-1","title":"환자와 전문가 모두에게 힘이 되는 실용적인 의료 영어 가이드","subtitle":"최신 연구가 증명하는 효과적인 의료 소통법과 상황별 필수 표현","date":"$D2026-04-22T03:58:16.966Z","featuredImage":"/images/blog/2026-04-22-medical-english-healthcare-1.jpg","excerpt":"의료 현장에서의 의사소통은 생명과 직결될 만큼 중요합니다. 이번 포스팅에서는 최신 연구 결과를 바탕으로 환자와 의료진이 서로를 더 잘 이해할 수 있는 실용적인 의료 영어 표현과 팁을 공유합니다."},{"slug":"2026-04-12-modal-verbs-possibility-certainty-1","title":"조동사로 표현하는 가능성과 확실성 더 이상 문법 책에 갇히지 말고 진짜 대화에서 써보세요","subtitle":"원어민의 뉘앙스를 결정짓는 가능성과 확실성의 미묘한 차이를 정복하는 실전 가이드","date":"$D2026-04-12T04:09:24.741Z","featuredImage":"/images/blog/2026-04-12-modal-verbs-possibility-certainty-1.jpg","excerpt":"조동사는 단순히 뜻을 외우는 것이 아니라 화자의 확신 정도를 표현하는 아주 섬세한 도구입니다. 실제 대화에서 확신의 강도에 따라 어떤 조동사를 선택해야 하는지 실용적인 예시와 함께 핵심을 짚어드립니다."}]}]]}]],null],null],null]},[[null,[["$","$L6",null,{"id":"article-structured-data-2025-10-19-complaint-handling-english-1",